  "description": "Dependency-free position-sizing and risk-management math for systematic trading. Portfolio risk gates (daily loss, drawdown, portfolio heat, concentration, losing streaks, session windows), five sizing methods (risk-budget, Kelly, optimal f, fixed ratio, volatility targeting), stop placement and trailing (ATR stops, chandelier, breakeven), and trade analysis (R-multiples, expectancy, SQN, risk of ruin, gap-loss stress). Pure arithmetic over plain numbers — no broker, no market data, no strategy opinions.",
